Colors: background #021B2E, text #DDF7FF, secondary text #93BFD3, accents #00E6D2, #8B7DFF, #FF5FC8. Font: "Anybody" from Google Fonts.
- Ring speed: 480px/s
- Ring push: 20px
- Auto ripple every: 2.6s

Add it to my existing project as a component that fits its framework; tell me which files changed.
Keep it smooth, accessible, and respectful of reduced motion."
`;

